# ST1cG: STG's end view, still, the gable flame flickering. e1m3's gable flame close
# (600,-890,110, fov 60), the Classic box, the torch flickering (`r_torchflicker 1`),
# Brightness 0.7. 4.5 s with a second of handle each end. The bottom fifth is the dark top
# of the slab under the flame, where the edit's diagram of the flame's luxels sits. The
# marks are the corners of the flame model's box.
#
# Under V3-24: "The user asked for that: a warm feeling."

map e1m3
skill 2
warmup 2

duration 6.5
fps 60
size 1920x1080

preset classic
mode 960x600
display 4:3
hud off
cvar gamma 0.7
cvar r_torchflicker 1

camera fixed 600,-890,110  -12,180
fov 60

mark fo 518,-890,120
mark f0 510.4,-897.6,107.6 radius 0
mark f1 525.6,-897.6,107.6 radius 0
mark f2 510.4,-882.4,107.6 radius 0
mark f3 525.6,-882.4,107.6 radius 0
mark f4 510.4,-897.6,163.6 radius 0
mark f5 525.6,-897.6,163.6 radius 0
mark f6 510.4,-882.4,163.6 radius 0
mark f7 525.6,-882.4,163.6 radius 0

sound on
events on
